        iso:hasTaskDescription """Validate and obtain approval from the customer of the software Requirement specification:
- Make corrections until the document is approved by the customer.""" ;
        iso:hasTaskID "SI.2.4" ;
        iso:hasTaskNote "NOTE 1: Software Requirement specification have to satisfy the needs and the agreed expectations/ including the user interface usability.",
